abstract: <p>RasCAL-2 is a software for the analysis of multi-contrast neutron reflectometry
  data. it&nbsp; is the successor to the original RasCAL software and the graphical
  user interface (GUI) for the Reflectivity Algorithm Toolbox. (<a href="https://github.com/RascalSoftware/python-RAT">https://github.com/RascalSoftware/python-RAT.</a>)</p>
